285.description:
Thematically focused adventure games help to attract more attention from users; repetitive shooters, zombie apocalypses, and other projects sooner or later become boring. If you're tired of these types of games, we recommend downloading them. Everybodys Gone to the Rapture The developers of this game decided to take a different approach to draw the player into an engaging world via torrent.

What is unique?
- A constantly changing and mysterious world;
- Six available heroes, each with their own story and behavior;
- The impending danger creates a unique atmosphere;
- Gameplay variety is provided by various situations from which you will have to find a way out (according to the developers, they are based on the works of John Wyndham and James Ballard).

