1709.description:
Fallout Shelter – is the most popular game on mobile platforms, which allowed a huge army of fans to test their skills in planning and creating their own shelter, which should provide a safe and comfortable existence for people who managed to survive a nuclear war.

Initial recommendations for successful play:
- think through the layout of the rooms in advance so that they not only fit together perfectly, but also allow you to save as much time as possible on completing various tasks;
- do not forget that each room has 2 places for the elevator shaft and 1 is immediately installed for use;
- 1 room occupies 1 segment, but there are also large rooms in 3 segments, to properly distribute the space, you can combine 3 small rooms into one large room;
- large rooms are one of the elements of a successful game;
- but don't rush, because at first there will be a catastrophic shortage of caps to buy various items, so in order to be able to accumulate game currency in the future, plan your free space correctly;
- and in order to start developing successfully, we recommend that you first install a room called Power Plant on the -1 floor, and then place water purification on the right, this way you can combine the room into one large room and make this cell of the room quite effective;
- at first, on the 1st floor you will have a cafeteria and living quarters, it is better to leave it like this, and at the advanced stages of development you can change this structure;
- There is no specific restriction on the placement of rooms next to each other in the game, so it is better to think about placing production and processing rooms next to each other in order to save time on obtaining various resources;
- distribute residents among rooms correctly; it is better to have one resident in each room so that everything works like a system mechanism;
- Be sure to build a medical center and a research lab; they will help you withstand raiders and unexpected radiation surges.

Installation:
1. Download the folder anywhere (make sure the folder path has Latin characters only).
2. Run and play!
